PahamTeks is a React 18 + Vite frontend and a Node.js ESM + Express/Apollo GraphQL backend. Read the root AGENTS.md first; it is the canonical instruction file. Check docs/ARCHITECTURE.md for current deployment and database behavior. Document/folder learning is planned, not implemented. Reuse shared speech and quiz utilities, avoid empty or swallowed catch blocks and browser alert(), protect secrets and local databases, and run `npm --prefix client run build` for frontend changes. Teksie is not a globally floating companion.
